    water; the missing hydrate qualifiers do not establish anhydrous reagents. JCM317
    explicitly prints Na2WO4·2H2O 4 mg with Na2SeO3 4 mg and 1 L distilled water.
    The shared nominal amounts and omitted NBRC hydrate do not establish either identical
    or distinct supplied preparations. Retain both source-bound partial proposals
    without merging or co-installing them as proved-distinct owners until supplied-form/applicability
    evidence or an explicitly reviewed common nominal scope resolves the overlap.
    The water amounts are added-water batch quantities, not instructions to make up
    a final litre.'
